(4150896, 596657, 67237, '<td valign="top">nice creative idea. <br/>I think B&amp;w was a good ellection for this kind of image, since it enhances dramma. Not crazy about the rpocessing of the innitial trace of the beam. Neither the pure white of the shinning. I think this would look much better if those two elements were dimmed a  little. Nice work overall.</td>', 'nice creative idea. I think B&w was a good ellection for this kind of image, since it enhances dramma. Not crazy about the rpocessing of the innitial trace of the beam. Neither the pure white of the shinning. I think this would look much better if those two elements were dimmed a  little. Nice work overall.', '2007-10-08 03:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
