(4151011, 596779, 49109, '<td valign="top">really like the idea, composition is good, but the branches are just too much OOF and the copter isn''t exactly sharp, too. overall it is a bit dull.</td>', 'really like the idea, composition is good, but the branches are just too much OOF and the copter isn''t exactly sharp, too. overall it is a bit dull.', '2007-10-08 05:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151013, 596768, 49109, '<td valign="top">good POV, focus and colors. Interesting outfit. Not sure if this is candid or staged, if it''s staged, it might have been better to show her face and lose the hat, the red scarf (or whatever) also distracts. It''s not clear at first sight that she''s searching sth in her bag</td>', 'good POV, focus and colors. Interesting outfit. Not sure if this is candid or staged, if it''s staged, it might have been better to show her face and lose the hat, the red scarf (or whatever) also distracts. It''s not clear at first sight that she''s searching sth in her bag', '2007-10-08 05:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151014, 596877, 49109, '<td valign="top">subject is not too interesting, the rotation also makes no sense to me</td>', 'subject is not too interesting, the rotation also makes no sense to me', '2007-10-08 05:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151018, 596906, 49109, '<td valign="top">you needed a real big shoehorn to enter this. obviously he''s not searching, he is making fire. besides that, the image is a tad dark and lacks of contrast</td>', 'you needed a real big shoehorn to enter this. obviously he''s not searching, he is making fire. besides that, the image is a tad dark and lacks of contrast', '2007-10-08 05:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151021, 596912, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice idea and good composition. a tad too dark overall. her expression doesn''t say "looking for adventure", though, it is rather bored</td>', 'nice idea and good composition. a tad too dark overall. her expression doesn''t say "looking for adventure", though, it is rather bored', '2007-10-08 05:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151022, 595921, 49109, '<td valign="top">good focus and composition, beautiful skies. wonder why he doesn''t look to his right, where the city seems to vanish in the sea...</td>', 'good focus and composition, beautiful skies. wonder why he doesn''t look to his right, where the city seems to vanish in the sea...', '2007-10-08 05:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151023, 596291, 49109, '<td valign="top">that''s funny! good focus and DOF. blown highlights distract a bit.  a square crop might have been more effective.</td>', 'that''s funny! good focus and DOF. blown highlights distract a bit.  a square crop might have been more effective.', '2007-10-08 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
