(4151640, 596886, 84887, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. It evokes more of the feeling of ''lost'' or ''abandonment'' than ''searching'' for me, but still tells a great story.</td>', 'I really like this photo. It evokes more of the feeling of ''lost'' or ''abandonment'' than ''searching'' for me, but still tells a great story.', '2007-10-08 12:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
