(4151663, 596958, 84887, '<td valign="top">Another one of my favorites in the challenge, great feeling of searching in this photo. The only thing I am slightly confused about is the missing dog poster. It appears to be a fake with a 555 number (can not quite read it) and also the same dog that is in the picture. I would like to think it is another reference to ''searching''</td>', 'Another one of my favorites in the challenge, great feeling of searching in this photo. The only thing I am slightly confused about is the missing dog poster. It appears to be a fake with a 555 number (can not quite read it) and also the same dog that is in the picture. I would like to think it is another reference to ''searching''', '2007-10-08 12:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151664, 596839, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a GREAT photo!   When this challenge came up, I was totally not seeing how ANY thing would make a great photo for this topic, but you have pulled it off!!  BRAVO!!!</td>', 'What a GREAT photo!   When this challenge came up, I was totally not seeing how ANY thing would make a great photo for this topic, but you have pulled it off!!  BRAVO!!!', '2007-10-08 12:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
