(4152908, 596630, 66494, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2007-10-08 21:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152911, 597016, 80976, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, good lighting, just feel its a stretch for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice portrait, good lighting, just feel its a stretch for the challenge.', '2007-10-08 21:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152912, 596493, 80976, '<td valign="top">Aww, nice sepia tones, could have benefitted from better focus on the doggie.</td>', 'Aww, nice sepia tones, could have benefitted from better focus on the doggie.', '2007-10-08 21:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152918, 596718, 66267, '<td valign="top">Looks like simms''s type of editing, good depth of field.</td>', 'Looks like simms''s type of editing, good depth of field.', '2007-10-08 21:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152922, 596886, 80976, '<td valign="top">Perfect expression, nice colors and good idea to use the blur.  Having said that, you could have applied the blur better by making it gradual using the lens blur function as the blurring of stray hairs and the shadows right beneath her feet hurt the image IMO.</td>', 'Perfect expression, nice colors and good idea to use the blur.  Having said that, you could have applied the blur better by making it gradual using the lens blur function as the blurring of stray hairs and the shadows right beneath her feet hurt the image IMO.', '2007-10-08 21:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152929, 596942, 80976, '<td valign="top">Very ethereal great setting, beautiful model, my only complaint is the blown out sky keeps drawing my eye away from her.</td>', 'Very ethereal great setting, beautiful model, my only complaint is the blown out sky keeps drawing my eye away from her.', '2007-10-08 21:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152933, 596621, 80976, '<td valign="top">lol nice.  Getting the(I assume its a cutout?) binoculors closer or increasing DOF would have helped make it more realistic.  Great idea.</td>', 'lol nice.  Getting the(I assume its a cutout?) binoculors closer or increasing DOF would have helped make it more realistic.  Great idea.', '2007-10-08 21:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152935, 596826, 80976, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, a white balance adjustment is in order for sure.</td>', 'Cool idea, a white balance adjustment is in order for sure.', '2007-10-08 21:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152938, 596676, 80976, '<td valign="top">lol covering all your bases? wonderful colors on that tree they really pop. I would have liked to see your model less blown out, maybe positioned more under the tree canopy.</td>', 'lol covering all your bases? wonderful colors on that tree they really pop. I would have liked to see your model less blown out, maybe positioned more under the tree canopy.', '2007-10-08 21:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152942, 596152, 80976, '<td valign="top">An ounce more DOF to bring the whole bee in would have done wonders IMO.</td>', 'An ounce more DOF to bring the whole bee in would have done wonders IMO.', '2007-10-08 22:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152944, 596287, 80976, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and DOF.</td>', 'Nice composition and DOF.', '2007-10-08 22:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152946, 596772, 80976, '<td valign="top">Including prey into the image would improve it by leaps and bounds. As it is it just looks like a lazy cat :(</td>', 'Including prey into the image would improve it by leaps and bounds. As it is it just looks like a lazy cat :(', '2007-10-08 22:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152951, 596889, 80976, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on all the leaves, very soft. good composition, I would personally have bumped the saturation ont he apple a touch.</td>', 'I love the lighting on all the leaves, very soft. good composition, I would personally have bumped the saturation ont he apple a touch.', '2007-10-08 22:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152955, 596872, 80976, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of this look (I''d call it antiqued for lack of a better term)  and nice lighting.  I also like the dodging of the outside to bring attention to the boy.  Great pic.</td>', 'Very effective use of this look (I''d call it antiqued for lack of a better term)  and nice lighting.  I also like the dodging of the outside to bring attention to the boy.  Great pic.', '2007-10-08 22:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152959, 595173, 80976, '<td valign="top">Nice light, probably could have cropped the bottom a bit more. The golf idea''s been a bit overdone in the challenge so that''ll probably hurt you with other voters.</td>', 'Nice light, probably could have cropped the bottom a bit more. The golf idea''s been a bit overdone in the challenge so that''ll probably hurt you with other voters.', '2007-10-08 22:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152964, 596203, 80976, '<td valign="top">Lacking in the challenge criteria, probably would have been better off in fauna.  That said its a nice capture, good pose from the "model" wish he was in the shade to cut harsh light.</td>', 'Lacking in the challenge criteria, probably would have been better off in fauna.  That said its a nice capture, good pose from the "model" wish he was in the shade to cut harsh light.', '2007-10-08 22:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152976, 596944, 80976, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, I feel it would be better with just the 5 front boys, taking out both the one in the back by the pole and the boy on the right with half his head cut off.</td>', 'Nice tones, I feel it would be better with just the 5 front boys, taking out both the one in the back by the pole and the boy on the right with half his head cut off.', '2007-10-08 22:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152992, 596090, 80976, '<td valign="top">Creative framing, pretty big shoehorn for the challenge description. Pink color cast doesn''t do anything for it.</td>', 'Creative framing, pretty big shoehorn for the challenge description. Pink color cast doesn''t do anything for it.', '2007-10-08 22:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152997, 595373, 80976, '<td valign="top">Image is very grainy, color is bland.</td>', 'Image is very grainy, color is bland.', '2007-10-08 22:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152998, 596291, 43555, '<td valign="top">I love it! :-)</td>', 'I love it! :-)', '2007-10-08 22:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153007, 596782, 80976, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you intended it, but this image really creeps me out.  It looks like the small children are chasing after the girl in the front and aren''t going to be kind when they catch her.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you intended it, but this image really creeps me out.  It looks like the small children are chasing after the girl in the front and aren''t going to be kind when they catch her.', '2007-10-08 22:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
