(4153226, 596628, 80976, '<td valign="top">Strong emotional idea, nice location. If you had waited a couple more hours for the sun to set the light would have made all the difference, and seems a little but short on contrast IMO.</td>', 'Strong emotional idea, nice location. If you had waited a couple more hours for the sun to set the light would have made all the difference, and seems a little but short on contrast IMO.', '2007-10-08 23:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
