(4153317, 595173, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not a golfer, but I''m sure i''d be frustrated as well.</td>', 'I''m not a golfer, but I''m sure i''d be frustrated as well.', '2007-10-08 23:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
