(4155232, 596769, 80976, '<td valign="top">Other than the title its lacking in the challenge criteria IMO, still nice composition and a good attempt at macro.  Some front fill light would have really set this off.</td>', 'Other than the title its lacking in the challenge criteria IMO, still nice composition and a good attempt at macro.  Some front fill light would have really set this off.', '2007-10-09 20:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
