(4155240, 595491, 80976, '<td valign="top">The composition is well done, the first thing I notice is that your blacks are pretty far from true black, which gives the whole image a gray cast to it.</td>', 'The composition is well done, the first thing I notice is that your blacks are pretty far from true black, which gives the whole image a gray cast to it.', '2007-10-09 20:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
