(4159166, 596756, 48697, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot but the burn or dodge tool you used left circles in the sky. Readjust the settings on the tool so that it blends better, such as decreasing the hardness.  You might need to calibrate your monitor as well becuase you may not be able to see them.</td>', 'This is a really cool shot but the burn or dodge tool you used left circles in the sky. Readjust the settings on the tool so that it blends better, such as decreasing the hardness.  You might need to calibrate your monitor as well becuase you may not be able to see them.', '2007-10-10 23:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
