(4159329, 595542, 68947, '<td valign="top">It would have been a great shot had you posed the apple picker on a higher ladder.  That way, you could have lit the subject with a spot light and his face would have been less shaded.  I can''t see his eyes clearly enough.  Perhaps, having him pose so that his head was completely out of the way of the branches would have worked better.  And, that''s not a Gucci Hoodie.  The apple pickers here wear Gucci.  Try to make it less candid and more staged next time.  BTW....how did you get that apple bush (or is it a tree?) into the studio?  And.....the apple just above his head to the right of his head, seems to have a hole in it.  I think that there must be a worm in it.  <br/> <br/>Oh wait, that was a fly on my monitor.  It''s ok.  Changed my vote from a 1 to a 9!  Nice image!</td>', 'It would have been a great shot had you posed the apple picker on a higher ladder.  That way, you could have lit the subject with a spot light and his face would have been less shaded.  I can''t see his eyes clearly enough.  Perhaps, having him pose so that his head was completely out of the way of the branches would have worked better.  And, that''s not a Gucci Hoodie.  The apple pickers here wear Gucci.  Try to make it less candid and more staged next time.  BTW....how did you get that apple bush (or is it a tree?) into the studio?  And.....the apple just above his head to the right of his head, seems to have a hole in it.  I think that there must be a worm in it.   Oh wait, that was a fly on my monitor.  It''s ok.  Changed my vote from a 1 to a 9!  Nice image!', '2007-10-11 00:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
