(4161473, 596912, 74015, '<td valign="top">great exposure and color.</td>', 'great exposure and color.', '2007-10-11 22:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161476, 596554, 74015, '<td valign="top">there seems to be some posterization artefacts or bad noise on the grass behind the children.  It looks as though the FG and BG don''t belong to the same image.</td>', 'there seems to be some posterization artefacts or bad noise on the grass behind the children.  It looks as though the FG and BG don''t belong to the same image.', '2007-10-11 22:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161477, 596826, 74015, '<td valign="top">very nice point of view - I like the composition.  I would prefer to see this with a more neutral white balance - there''s an orange cast from the incandescent lighting.</td>', 'very nice point of view - I like the composition.  I would prefer to see this with a more neutral white balance - there''s an orange cast from the incandescent lighting.', '2007-10-11 22:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161479, 596978, 74015, '<td valign="top">interesting subject but the face is blown out and you''ve lost all details in the hand from a too strong flash.</td>', 'interesting subject but the face is blown out and you''ve lost all details in the hand from a too strong flash.', '2007-10-11 22:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161480, 595017, 74015, '<td valign="top">great use of selective desat - i really like the feel conveyed by the grain you added.</td>', 'great use of selective desat - i really like the feel conveyed by the grain you added.', '2007-10-11 22:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161483, 596731, 74015, '<td valign="top">Not sure I understand your title and it took me a while to understand what she was holding.  Very nice silhouette though I''m sure it meets the challenge subject.</td>', 'Not sure I understand your title and it took me a while to understand what she was holding.  Very nice silhouette though I''m sure it meets the challenge subject.', '2007-10-11 22:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161557, 595655, 7778, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lightplay from soft grain to hard contrasts. <br/>The arrow-like silhouette entering both image and the (depicted) room does so as softly as it provides the dominant point of interest. The light cast forward into the dark echoes the geometry without completely defining it. This palliates the ample negative space of the foreground, making it easy to explore and pleasurable to come up empty.<br/> <br/>The sharp diagonal stemming into the top right of the image anchors it strongly and without any ambiguities.<br/> <br/>This is a quiet capture with an intriguing composition balancing spatial geometries and artifice against incidental ones. The looming, hood-like silhouette, however, provides a little domestic "noire" and just enough humour to laugh at the accomplishment and the trivia of the unknown - delightful!</td>', 'Wonderful lightplay from soft grain to hard contrasts. The arrow-like silhouette entering both image and the (depicted) room does so as softly as it provides the dominant point of interest. The light cast forward into the dark echoes the geometry without completely defining it. This palliates the ample negative space of the foreground, making it easy to explore and pleasurable to come up empty. The sharp diagonal stemming into the top right of the image anchors it strongly and without any ambiguities. This is a quiet capture with an intriguing composition balancing spatial geometries and artifice against incidental ones. The looming, hood-like silhouette, however, provides a little domestic "noire" and just enough humour to laugh at the accomplishment and the trivia of the unknown - delightful!', '2007-10-11 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161627, 596767, 81342, '<td valign="top">great shot. grats. well done.</td>', 'great shot. grats. well done.', '2007-10-11 23:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161691, 596567, 42367, '<td valign="top">You''re the good things.</td>', 'You''re the good things.', '2007-10-12 00:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161729, 597027, 48697, '<td valign="top">funny idea, the lighting looks a bit harsh and it appears oof.</td>', 'funny idea, the lighting looks a bit harsh and it appears oof.', '2007-10-12 00:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161735, 596877, 48697, '<td valign="top">Good exposure on this shot but I feel the angle you used takes away from the message of the tower looking for a signal up in the sky.</td>', 'Good exposure on this shot but I feel the angle you used takes away from the message of the tower looking for a signal up in the sky.', '2007-10-12 00:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161739, 596756, 54540, '<td valign="top">Great clouds, fantastic composition, but what in the world is happening in the water there!  (Good entry!)</td>', 'Great clouds, fantastic composition, but what in the world is happening in the water there!  (Good entry!)', '2007-10-12 00:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161742, 596685, 48697, '<td valign="top">Cool shot of Meercats. I do feel that there is too much negative space above them and the tree atcually draws the eyes upwards and away from you subjects.</td>', 'Cool shot of Meercats. I do feel that there is too much negative space above them and the tree atcually draws the eyes upwards and away from you subjects.', '2007-10-12 00:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161747, 596978, 48697, '<td valign="top">good idea and I like the PP on this although the blownout face and hand really dominates the eye and is a bit distracting.</td>', 'good idea and I like the PP on this although the blownout face and hand really dominates the eye and is a bit distracting.', '2007-10-12 00:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161752, 596162, 48697, '<td valign="top">I feel the slanted horizon line is a bit distracting and the composition seems to be lacking. Centered composition can work but I feel that by using some negative space in front of the kid or applying the rule of thirds could have benifited this shot.</td>', 'I feel the slanted horizon line is a bit distracting and the composition seems to be lacking. Centered composition can work but I feel that by using some negative space in front of the kid or applying the rule of thirds could have benifited this shot.', '2007-10-12 00:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161753, 596226, 48697, '<td valign="top">cool shot!</td>', 'cool shot!', '2007-10-12 00:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161756, 596912, 48697, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and nice PP. The model reminds me of Jennifer Gray from Farris Buellers Day Off!</td>', 'Nice shot and nice PP. The model reminds me of Jennifer Gray from Farris Buellers Day Off!', '2007-10-12 00:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161757, 596958, 13688, '<td valign="top">the more i look at this the more fantastic the story becomes.</td>', 'the more i look at this the more fantastic the story becomes.', '2007-10-12 00:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161759, 596291, 48697, '<td valign="top">LOL, great capture! Very sharp image and well done!</td>', 'LOL, great capture! Very sharp image and well done!', '2007-10-12 00:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161764, 596768, 48697, '<td valign="top">Cool shot and I like the PP.  I''m not sure what tht is in her hand but I''m going to assume that it is a purse and she is looking for her roller skate key, if so brilliant! though I might have used a purse that looks more like a purse though. I could be way off though.</td>', 'Cool shot and I like the PP.  I''m not sure what tht is in her hand but I''m going to assume that it is a purse and she is looking for her roller skate key, if so brilliant! though I might have used a purse that looks more like a purse though. I could be way off though.', '2007-10-12 00:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161769, 597007, 48697, '<td valign="top">The crop tool you used to straighten the picture left white backgrounds on the image.</td>', 'The crop tool you used to straighten the picture left white backgrounds on the image.', '2007-10-12 00:44:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4161772, 596590, 48697, '<td valign="top">The picture seems dark and very noisey.</td>', 'The picture seems dark and very noisey.', '2007-10-12 00:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161776, 596782, 13688, '<td valign="top">this is great stuff.  if a lolybag is a pack of pissed-off zombie kids roaming the countryside, killing all adults in their path... then the title really fits.</td>', 'this is great stuff.  if a lolybag is a pack of pissed-off zombie kids roaming the countryside, killing all adults in their path... then the title really fits.', '2007-10-12 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161778, 596777, 48697, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and nice b&amp;w treatment. I do feel that the message in the name of the photo would have been better achieved by placing the child in the foreground of the photo with the road in front of him instead of behind him.  I get the feeling, from this photo, of not looking back or putting your past behind you since the majority of the road is behind the child.  By putting a majority of the road in front of the child it would give more of the appearance of searching or looking to the future of the road that lies foward. jmo and I stil think its a cool shot, I just got a different take on it.</td>', 'Cool idea and nice b&w treatment. I do feel that the message in the name of the photo would have been better achieved by placing the child in the foreground of the photo with the road in front of him instead of behind him.  I get the feeling, from this photo, of not looking back or putting your past behind you since the majority of the road is behind the child.  By putting a majority of the road in front of the child it would give more of the appearance of searching or looking to the future of the road that lies foward. jmo and I stil think its a cool shot, I just got a different take on it.', '2007-10-12 00:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161794, 596826, 13688, '<td valign="top">i wish i had a nickel for everyone on this site who couldn''t be bothered to spend a couple extra seconds and figure out that was someone dumping out a bag or purse. i can''t figure out how you got the wall to blur unless you used a photoshop filter.  but i think that overall blur makes for an odd alternate kind of universe feel.  One with our harried lives and everything spinning out of control and the other where hidden keys live that''s all mellow and relaxed and totally stationary.</td>', 'i wish i had a nickel for everyone on this site who couldn''t be bothered to spend a couple extra seconds and figure out that was someone dumping out a bag or purse. i can''t figure out how you got the wall to blur unless you used a photoshop filter.  but i think that overall blur makes for an odd alternate kind of universe feel.  One with our harried lives and everything spinning out of control and the other where hidden keys live that''s all mellow and relaxed and totally stationary.', '2007-10-12 01:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161807, 596463, 54540, '<td valign="top">This is a FANTASTIC perspective!  Good thinking!  The color of the corn in the front right really caught my eye.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a FANTASTIC perspective!  Good thinking!  The color of the corn in the front right really caught my eye.  Well done.', '2007-10-12 01:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161834, 597027, 54540, '<td valign="top">LOL funny!  Extra point.</td>', 'LOL funny!  Extra point.', '2007-10-12 01:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161852, 596768, 54540, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot - maybe stretching the "searching" in my opinion, but I really like this shot for it''s colors and finish.</td>', 'Fantastic shot - maybe stretching the "searching" in my opinion, but I really like this shot for it''s colors and finish.', '2007-10-12 01:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161860, 596958, 80087, '<td valign="top">cool idea, is that the dog on the wall?</td>', 'cool idea, is that the dog on the wall?', '2007-10-12 01:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161870, 595921, 54540, '<td valign="top">Simply incredible.  The title seals it!  I appreciate all of the elements that are in this photograph - very well done!  (My highest vote of the bunch!)</td>', 'Simply incredible.  The title seals it!  I appreciate all of the elements that are in this photograph - very well done!  (My highest vote of the bunch!)', '2007-10-12 01:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161882, 597022, 79540, '<td valign="top">winner</td>', 'winner', '2007-10-12 01:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161992, 596718, 84520, '<td valign="top">I think the plane of focus is perfect, and it makes the image.  There''s great depth and the black border does an excellent job framing the image.  <br/> <br/>Also, the leaves (in focus) are so sharp i could cut myself!</td>', 'I think the plane of focus is perfect, and it makes the image.  There''s great depth and the black border does an excellent job framing the image.   Also, the leaves (in focus) are so sharp i could cut myself!', '2007-10-12 02:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4161997, 595921, 84520, '<td valign="top">I wish that the man was sharper...is this a single exposure HDR?  There''s definitly a halo around his shirt and jeans.<br/> <br/>However, the idea is creative and the composition is well executed; I can''t fault the entire image for a few minor flaws--8</td>', 'I wish that the man was sharper...is this a single exposure HDR?  There''s definitly a halo around his shirt and jeans. However, the idea is creative and the composition is well executed; I can''t fault the entire image for a few minor flaws--8', '2007-10-12 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4162012, 596628, 84520, '<td valign="top">This image is well composed.   However, I think you could''ve done a few things in post processing to strengthen the viewers emotional connection with the loss that the man is feeling at his (wifes?) absence.<br/> <br/>Sudden loss is a powerful and reality altering experiance.  Shot in black and white, with some dodging and burning to darken the dock foreground and the distracting trees in the background  would automatically draw the viewers attention to the center of the image--the grieving man and the empty seat.  Because of the composition, the center (the base of the chair to the top of the man) tells me everything I need to know.  Emphasize it.</td>', 'This image is well composed.   However, I think you could''ve done a few things in post processing to strengthen the viewers emotional connection with the loss that the man is feeling at his (wifes?) absence. Sudden loss is a powerful and reality altering experiance.  Shot in black and white, with some dodging and burning to darken the dock foreground and the distracting trees in the background  would automatically draw the viewers attention to the center of the image--the grieving man and the empty seat.  Because of the composition, the center (the base of the chair to the top of the man) tells me everything I need to know.  Emphasize it.', '2007-10-12 03:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4162015, 596770, 84520, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  Very creative and well executed.</td>', 'Fantastic!  Very creative and well executed.', '2007-10-12 03:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4162199, 596978, 82431, '<td valign="top">Flash is a bit too harsh</td>', 'Flash is a bit too harsh', '2007-10-12 07:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4162205, 596886, 82431, '<td valign="top">OMG, my heart almost leapt at this.... a child''s (and parent''s) worst nightmare - very well executed.</td>', 'OMG, my heart almost leapt at this.... a child''s (and parent''s) worst nightmare - very well executed.', '2007-10-12 07:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
