(4162423, 596886, 53147, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 on the first run through. Coming back to comment and look at it a bit closer I can see some technical issues with it. Primarily the halo around the girls head. The selective blur I like as it makes her stand out well but a bit cleaner job editing would have been nice. Did she find her parents?</td>', 'I gave this an 8 on the first run through. Coming back to comment and look at it a bit closer I can see some technical issues with it. Primarily the halo around the girls head. The selective blur I like as it makes her stand out well but a bit cleaner job editing would have been nice. Did she find her parents?', '2007-10-12 10:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
