(4164083, 596463, 7778, '<td valign="top">A dynamic ambiant image with great perspective and excellent use of colour. If the more poorly lit objects and textures (in the pit) and the front and face of the central figure (man in red) were brought a little better, we would, IMO, have a <i>great</i> photograph leaving little or no room for improvement.<br/> <br/>The atmosphere, however, is contagious enough to rouse anyone''s senses.<br/>A 6 on my rigorous scale.</td>', 'A dynamic ambiant image with great perspective and excellent use of colour. If the more poorly lit objects and textures (in the pit) and the front and face of the central figure (man in red) were brought a little better, we would, IMO, have a great photograph leaving little or no room for improvement. The atmosphere, however, is contagious enough to rouse anyone''s senses.A 6 on my rigorous scale.', '2007-10-13 00:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
