(4165352, 595659, 73601, '<td valign="top">nice fall colors, would of cropped some off the left. the focus is off on your subject, the car is a distraction</td>', 'nice fall colors, would of cropped some off the left. the focus is off on your subject, the car is a distraction', '2007-10-13 21:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
