(4165359, 596756, 1031, '<td valign="top">First off, nice combination of action and cloudscape in tricky lighting.<br/> <br/>I don''t usually comment on titles, but in this case, where you''ve (at least as I learned them) transposed these two phrases, and given the nature of the clouds, the correct next phrase would have fit as well.<br/> <br/>From <b>Summertime</b> by George Gershwin<br/> <br/>Summertime, and the livin'' is easy<br/>Fish are jumpin'' and the cotton is high</td>', 'First off, nice combination of action and cloudscape in tricky lighting. I don''t usually comment on titles, but in this case, where you''ve (at least as I learned them) transposed these two phrases, and given the nature of the clouds, the correct next phrase would have fit as well. From Summertime by George Gershwin Summertime, and the livin'' is easyFish are jumpin'' and the cotton is high', '2007-10-13 21:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165360, 596685, 73601, '<td valign="top">cute little things, I don''t care for how top heavy this is, would of cropped tighter</td>', 'cute little things, I don''t care for how top heavy this is, would of cropped tighter', '2007-10-13 21:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
