(4165810, 596654, 84907, '<td valign="top">Unique because of the subjects, but I need a different title to firmly link to the challenge.  They could be searching for tiger just as easily as search for koala.  For some, they like the mystery, for me it adds interest if you tell me what was so interesting I have a better link to the shot.</td>', 'Unique because of the subjects, but I need a different title to firmly link to the challenge.  They could be searching for tiger just as easily as search for koala.  For some, they like the mystery, for me it adds interest if you tell me what was so interesting I have a better link to the shot.', '2007-10-14 00:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165824, 596685, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like so much about this shot.  The critters are great and the tree adds some serious character to the shot.  IMO too much tree though my guess is that there was something below them that required the framing this way, but just my opinion a little less tree.</td>', 'I like so much about this shot.  The critters are great and the tree adds some serious character to the shot.  IMO too much tree though my guess is that there was something below them that required the framing this way, but just my opinion a little less tree.', '2007-10-14 01:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
