(4165834, 596695, 84907, '<td valign="top">Shooting from this angle creates an interesting effect, but another thought might be to see where the dishes are looking.  Right now we are not looking where the dishes are looking and we can''t see if there is anybody out where they are looking.  Clearly they are for further away, but looking where they are looking gives a different approach.</td>', 'Shooting from this angle creates an interesting effect, but another thought might be to see where the dishes are looking.  Right now we are not looking where the dishes are looking and we can''t see if there is anybody out where they are looking.  Clearly they are for further away, but looking where they are looking gives a different approach.', '2007-10-14 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
