(4165842, 596784, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the selective color.  The light play on her face is very interesting and makes the image very memorable.  Her hair on the left of image (her right) is a bit distracting as the fly away hairs instantly scream Something About Mary.  Great capture and the uniqueness is excellent.</td>', 'I like the selective color.  The light play on her face is very interesting and makes the image very memorable.  Her hair on the left of image (her right) is a bit distracting as the fly away hairs instantly scream Something About Mary.  Great capture and the uniqueness is excellent.', '2007-10-14 01:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
