(4165848, 596996, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the concept on this shot quite a bit.  The black outfit on the black purse causes some detail loss and muddles the shot a bit to me.  Additionally the background used gives the appearance of noise in the shot.  Also the watch has some blue that attracts attention away from the rest of the shot.</td>', 'I like the concept on this shot quite a bit.  The black outfit on the black purse causes some detail loss and muddles the shot a bit to me.  Additionally the background used gives the appearance of noise in the shot.  Also the watch has some blue that attracts attention away from the rest of the shot.', '2007-10-14 01:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165850, 596904, 84907, '<td valign="top">Picking what to make B&amp;W and what to leave in color is a difficult task, and I think you made a great choice here.  In what was probably a very boggy environment that would have made the shot bland you made a great choice to spice the shot with B&amp;W.  Way to take what could have been an average shot and turn it into a great shot by seeing it outside the box.</td>', 'Picking what to make B&W and what to leave in color is a difficult task, and I think you made a great choice here.  In what was probably a very boggy environment that would have made the shot bland you made a great choice to spice the shot with B&W.  Way to take what could have been an average shot and turn it into a great shot by seeing it outside the box.', '2007-10-14 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165851, 596590, 84907, '<td valign="top">tons of low light noise that is distracting me a ton as to what the image is trying to help me see.</td>', 'tons of low light noise that is distracting me a ton as to what the image is trying to help me see.', '2007-10-14 01:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
