(4165924, 596756, 84907, '<td valign="top">This image overwhelms me a bit.  Almost as if there is too much going on.  Huge and amazing sky (which also has some of the signs of a round spray paint type tool in the upper right) crazy jumping fish of doom.  Again don''t look native to the shot.  I think either the sky or the fish but both is just overwhelming.  And if you include the sky make sure you blur or dodge out the circles in the upper right there.  I have never seen perfectly round dark spots in the sky.</td>', 'This image overwhelms me a bit.  Almost as if there is too much going on.  Huge and amazing sky (which also has some of the signs of a round spray paint type tool in the upper right) crazy jumping fish of doom.  Again don''t look native to the shot.  I think either the sky or the fish but both is just overwhelming.  And if you include the sky make sure you blur or dodge out the circles in the upper right there.  I have never seen perfectly round dark spots in the sky.', '2007-10-14 02:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165927, 596944, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the image, but my eyes were instantly drawn to #20''s mouth.  Not sure if he has a rouge tooth on his lip or if something is coming out of his mouth, but it was an instant distraction for me.</td>', 'I like the image, but my eyes were instantly drawn to #20''s mouth.  Not sure if he has a rouge tooth on his lip or if something is coming out of his mouth, but it was an instant distraction for me.', '2007-10-14 02:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165930, 596951, 84907, '<td valign="top">Ahhh the superimposition of a city!!  I really like this concept.  For me though more photoshop work to make the background more wispy.  The entire city is all one foggy level and I have never seen that happen in person.  However matched beautifully and as I said like the concept a great deal.</td>', 'Ahhh the superimposition of a city!!  I really like this concept.  For me though more photoshop work to make the background more wispy.  The entire city is all one foggy level and I have never seen that happen in person.  However matched beautifully and as I said like the concept a great deal.', '2007-10-14 02:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165933, 597009, 84907, '<td valign="top">great eyes and nice capture.  The black area takes up too much space IMO but still a great capture.</td>', 'great eyes and nice capture.  The black area takes up too much space IMO but still a great capture.', '2007-10-14 02:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165939, 596683, 84907, '<td valign="top">Well, she isn''t doing a good job, she is on pavement in sandals.  :)  I need different title here to go for this one.</td>', 'Well, she isn''t doing a good job, she is on pavement in sandals.  :)  I need different title here to go for this one.', '2007-10-14 02:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165948, 597023, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the half face, and the photoshop grainy works really well with this shot.</td>', 'I like the half face, and the photoshop grainy works really well with this shot.', '2007-10-14 02:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165953, 597013, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the positioning within the photo  LOL you are two lines from your tick tack toe board  :)</td>', 'I like the positioning within the photo  LOL you are two lines from your tick tack toe board  :)', '2007-10-14 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165957, 595659, 84907, '<td valign="top">Nothing really appears to be in focus.  Where is the main focus?</td>', 'Nothing really appears to be in focus.  Where is the main focus?', '2007-10-14 02:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165960, 596994, 84907, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture to get the insect, but in getting the insect you also got some serious blur that distracts me.</td>', 'Excellent capture to get the insect, but in getting the insect you also got some serious blur that distracts me.', '2007-10-14 02:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165965, 594968, 84907, '<td valign="top">huh??  I guess its a find the deer, but the foreground is completely distracting even for a find the deer type shot.</td>', 'huh??  I guess its a find the deer, but the foreground is completely distracting even for a find the deer type shot.', '2007-10-14 02:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165968, 596914, 84907, '<td valign="top">LOL there are clearly a couple of these so not particularly original, but I like this one.  The eye with the use of magnifier is a nice touch and adds just the interest you need.</td>', 'LOL there are clearly a couple of these so not particularly original, but I like this one.  The eye with the use of magnifier is a nice touch and adds just the interest you need.', '2007-10-14 02:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165972, 596864, 84907, '<td valign="top">LOL a good hand totally inserted  :)  I like the image for its fun, and I could buy the arm but above the wrist it looks almost completely fake.</td>', 'LOL a good hand totally inserted  :)  I like the image for its fun, and I could buy the arm but above the wrist it looks almost completely fake.', '2007-10-14 02:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165975, 595655, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the vast majority of the image, but your main shadow fun somehow instantly reminds me of Spy vs. Spy.  not necessarily a bad thing, but at least wanted to let you know what your image brings to mind at first glance for me.</td>', 'I like the vast majority of the image, but your main shadow fun somehow instantly reminds me of Spy vs. Spy.  not necessarily a bad thing, but at least wanted to let you know what your image brings to mind at first glance for me.', '2007-10-14 02:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165978, 596845, 84907, '<td valign="top">Where is my focus supposed to go??  To one of my foreground subjects or to the mountainous background??  If I am not sure that is potentially a problem for the image.</td>', 'Where is my focus supposed to go??  To one of my foreground subjects or to the mountainous background??  If I am not sure that is potentially a problem for the image.', '2007-10-14 02:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165980, 594735, 84907, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like it.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like it.', '2007-10-14 02:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165981, 596877, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the sky to contrast the otherwise boring signal tower.</td>', 'I like the sky to contrast the otherwise boring signal tower.', '2007-10-14 02:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165985, 596939, 84907, '<td valign="top">Interesting, and I like the slight window frame as if you camera was spying on a friend stuck in school.  I might actually like a bit more window in the frame to give that feeling even more.</td>', 'Interesting, and I like the slight window frame as if you camera was spying on a friend stuck in school.  I might actually like a bit more window in the frame to give that feeling even more.', '2007-10-14 02:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165988, 595261, 84907, '<td valign="top">The amount of photoshop used makes this shot look almost video gamey.  That can be really good or really bad depending upon the viewer.</td>', 'The amount of photoshop used makes this shot look almost video gamey.  That can be really good or really bad depending upon the viewer.', '2007-10-14 02:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165993, 596777, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the image.  A couple of thoughts though.  The title indicates looking forward.  So I would love for the image to show more future path for our young little friend rather than so much path behind.</td>', 'I like the image.  A couple of thoughts though.  The title indicates looking forward.  So I would love for the image to show more future path for our young little friend rather than so much path behind.', '2007-10-14 02:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165995, 596225, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the blur and the concept.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like the blur and the concept.  Nice work.', '2007-10-14 02:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165997, 596872, 84907, '<td valign="top">My eyes are instantly drawn to right under our poor lost young man''s hat.  And there I see photoshop not image.</td>', 'My eyes are instantly drawn to right under our poor lost young man''s hat.  And there I see photoshop not image.', '2007-10-14 02:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4165998, 596630, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the thought and the way the lighting is used.</td>', 'I like the thought and the way the lighting is used.', '2007-10-14 02:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166004, 596189, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the image quite a bit the title doesn''t really do it for me, but I like the image.</td>', 'I like the image quite a bit the title doesn''t really do it for me, but I like the image.', '2007-10-14 02:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166053, 595027, 42013, '<td valign="top">Likely to do well although I get the chills when I look at this image.</td>', 'Likely to do well although I get the chills when I look at this image.', '2007-10-14 02:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166057, 595921, 42013, '<td valign="top">This looks like the city where metatate lives. Don''t remember where. I like the exagerated(sp) perspective.</td>', 'This looks like the city where metatate lives. Don''t remember where. I like the exagerated(sp) perspective.', '2007-10-14 02:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166161, 596904, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great image, only thing I noticed was my eye tended to be drawn toward the top, toward the blurry branches, and away from the bird. Perhaps a tighter crop, with the bird placed in the upper right?</td>', 'Great image, only thing I noticed was my eye tended to be drawn toward the top, toward the blurry branches, and away from the bird. Perhaps a tighter crop, with the bird placed in the upper right?', '2007-10-14 04:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166162, 596939, 83313, '<td valign="top">good photo. It leaves me wondering why he is slapping or touching his head.</td>', 'good photo. It leaves me wondering why he is slapping or touching his head.', '2007-10-14 04:32:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4166165, 596654, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very good. the colors of the children''s clothes contrast nicely. The only improvement I would suggest is to clone out the overhead wires.</td>', 'Very good. the colors of the children''s clothes contrast nicely. The only improvement I would suggest is to clone out the overhead wires.', '2007-10-14 04:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166166, 596263, 83313, '<td valign="top">It looks the part. One minor nitpick: colors don''t strike me as quite strong enough for a recreation of a storybook scene.</td>', 'It looks the part. One minor nitpick: colors don''t strike me as quite strong enough for a recreation of a storybook scene.', '2007-10-14 04:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166167, 596784, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice conveyance of emotion and I like the use of desaturation here. (and look at all those freckles!)</td>', 'Nice conveyance of emotion and I like the use of desaturation here. (and look at all those freckles!)', '2007-10-14 04:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166168, 596398, 83313, '<td valign="top">A slight bump in color may give it more impact. otherwise nice.</td>', 'A slight bump in color may give it more impact. otherwise nice.', '2007-10-14 04:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166169, 596564, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well done. My eye comes in at his tail and swoops around up to his head.</td>', 'Well done. My eye comes in at his tail and swoops around up to his head.', '2007-10-14 04:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166170, 596789, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice expression. Kids are great subjects when you can catch them unaware. Details on the shirt are somewhat blown out.</td>', 'Nice expression. Kids are great subjects when you can catch them unaware. Details on the shirt are somewhat blown out.', '2007-10-14 04:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166171, 596611, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting view. I''d like to know how you exposed this and with what equipment. I''ll check back on it after the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting view. I''d like to know how you exposed this and with what equipment. I''ll check back on it after the challenge.', '2007-10-14 04:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166172, 596463, 83313, '<td valign="top">A great shot of an ordinary scene. Love the smoky look.</td>', 'A great shot of an ordinary scene. Love the smoky look.', '2007-10-14 04:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166173, 596876, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is just an odd view, or an odd looking critter. Is it a moth? Nonetheless, a good photo. Good DOF for a macro like this. Look at the detail on that hair!</td>', 'Not sure if this is just an odd view, or an odd looking critter. Is it a moth? Nonetheless, a good photo. Good DOF for a macro like this. Look at the detail on that hair!', '2007-10-14 04:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166174, 596556, 83313, '<td valign="top">Detail ont he water seems a touch too bright, otherwise very good.</td>', 'Detail ont he water seems a touch too bright, otherwise very good.', '2007-10-14 04:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166175, 595470, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice curve of the clouds. I like the sunset that is more red than orange.</td>', 'Nice curve of the clouds. I like the sunset that is more red than orange.', '2007-10-14 04:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166176, 596612, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice clear picture, with good detail and colors, but it seems too static. He''s pretty dead center and that hurts the composition.</td>', 'A nice clear picture, with good detail and colors, but it seems too static. He''s pretty dead center and that hurts the composition.', '2007-10-14 04:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166177, 596999, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good use of b/w and motion blur.</td>', 'Good use of b/w and motion blur.', '2007-10-14 04:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166178, 595659, 83313, '<td valign="top">In tweaking the fall colors you made her face look orange. She looks like an Oompa-Loompa. The composition would have also worked better without the car in the background.</td>', 'In tweaking the fall colors you made her face look orange. She looks like an Oompa-Loompa. The composition would have also worked better without the car in the background.', '2007-10-14 04:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166179, 596902, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can''t get much more into the searching theme than this! Good image.</td>', 'Can''t get much more into the searching theme than this! Good image.', '2007-10-14 05:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166180, 596610, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hope they are not the poisonous kind!</td>', 'Hope they are not the poisonous kind!', '2007-10-14 05:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166181, 596090, 83313, '<td valign="top">The magenta cast throws me off.</td>', 'The magenta cast throws me off.', '2007-10-14 05:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166182, 596567, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost a little too saturated, but it works well for this idea. Very well done. Gave it a high rating and made it a fave.</td>', 'Almost a little too saturated, but it works well for this idea. Very well done. Gave it a high rating and made it a fave.', '2007-10-14 05:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166184, 596877, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good try on the angled view, but I think it was too much.</td>', 'Good try on the angled view, but I think it was too much.', '2007-10-14 05:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166185, 596772, 83313, '<td valign="top">A natural subject for searching. Cats are always after something.</td>', 'A natural subject for searching. Cats are always after something.', '2007-10-14 05:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166186, 596685, 83313, '<td valign="top">The composition works well with the title.</td>', 'The composition works well with the title.', '2007-10-14 05:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166187, 596673, 83313, '<td valign="top">It is that time of year again, isn''t it? Good job on this.</td>', 'It is that time of year again, isn''t it? Good job on this.', '2007-10-14 05:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166188, 597023, 83313, '<td valign="top">An excellent example of high ISO noise being put to creative use. Was it noise, or was it induced in post processing?</td>', 'An excellent example of high ISO noise being put to creative use. Was it noise, or was it induced in post processing?', '2007-10-14 05:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166189, 597027, 83313, '<td valign="top">Does not seem to have any interest, with harsh shadows from the flash.</td>', 'Does not seem to have any interest, with harsh shadows from the flash.', '2007-10-14 05:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166191, 596903, 83313, '<td valign="top">As many dragonflies as I am seeing here, I still find them totally cool to look at.</td>', 'As many dragonflies as I am seeing here, I still find them totally cool to look at.', '2007-10-14 05:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166192, 596867, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but I''d be interested in seeing the color version.</td>', 'Nicely done, but I''d be interested in seeing the color version.', '2007-10-14 05:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166193, 596921, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just great. I''m making this one a fave.</td>', 'Just great. I''m making this one a fave.', '2007-10-14 05:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166194, 596769, 83313, '<td valign="top">The angle of the light gives it some great detail. Good DOF as well.</td>', 'The angle of the light gives it some great detail. Good DOF as well.', '2007-10-14 05:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166195, 597020, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not bad, good framing, but kind of strikes me as casual snapshot with a very good camera.</td>', 'Not bad, good framing, but kind of strikes me as casual snapshot with a very good camera.', '2007-10-14 05:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166229, 596716, 45631, '<td valign="top">This photo looks over processed yet it is not sharp.  Good take on the challenge though.</td>', 'This photo looks over processed yet it is not sharp.  Good take on the challenge though.', '2007-10-14 07:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166230, 596756, 45631, '<td valign="top">Amazing clouds in this shot and nice silhouette.</td>', 'Amazing clouds in this shot and nice silhouette.', '2007-10-14 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166383, 595027, 78396, '<td valign="top">Great composition, because of those strong diagonal lines. Great use of colors too, and intriguing mood.</td>', 'Great composition, because of those strong diagonal lines. Great use of colors too, and intriguing mood.', '2007-10-14 11:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166493, 596942, 84907, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast but the background is a bit cluttered in my opinion and takes away from the foreground contrast.</td>', 'Nice contrast but the background is a bit cluttered in my opinion and takes away from the foreground contrast.', '2007-10-14 12:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166495, 596886, 84907, '<td valign="top">Poor thing!  Very nice capture.  I really like the image and what you have done with the background to make the scene authentic but keep the background from overpowering our poor lost little girl.</td>', 'Poor thing!  Very nice capture.  I really like the image and what you have done with the background to make the scene authentic but keep the background from overpowering our poor lost little girl.', '2007-10-14 12:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166496, 596287, 84907, '<td valign="top">:)  So frustrating!!!  I like the shot and the way you approached it.</td>', ':)  So frustrating!!!  I like the shot and the way you approached it.', '2007-10-14 12:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166498, 596610, 84907, '<td valign="top">Fun selective color.  In this case the B&amp;W and selective color do exactly what they are supposed to by bringing attention where it should and enhancing the photo rather than looking like a gimmick.  Very nice job.</td>', 'Fun selective color.  In this case the B&W and selective color do exactly what they are supposed to by bringing attention where it should and enhancing the photo rather than looking like a gimmick.  Very nice job.', '2007-10-14 12:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166501, 596820, 84907, '<td valign="top">Looks like she found it.  Not sure how well it fits with the theme, but I like the image.  The light play and the angle are great for me.  Additionally the color contrast the snowcone brings in make the shot even better.  Nice job.</td>', 'Looks like she found it.  Not sure how well it fits with the theme, but I like the image.  The light play and the angle are great for me.  Additionally the color contrast the snowcone brings in make the shot even better.  Nice job.', '2007-10-14 12:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166504, 595470, 84907, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  The entire package is just plain gorgeous.  My only complaint and I am being a bit nit picky is the white on the outfit of your soul searcher on the dock can be a bit distracting.  Black that out on photoshop might minimize distraction at least in my opinion, but I assure you that is not enough to keep me from voting this an amazing shot.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  The entire package is just plain gorgeous.  My only complaint and I am being a bit nit picky is the white on the outfit of your soul searcher on the dock can be a bit distracting.  Black that out on photoshop might minimize distraction at least in my opinion, but I assure you that is not enough to keep me from voting this an amazing shot.', '2007-10-14 12:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166510, 596836, 84907, '<td valign="top">The model poses look a bit stiff to me, but I like the capture quite a bit.  Original idea, something like "Somewhere in Time" or something.</td>', 'The model poses look a bit stiff to me, but I like the capture quite a bit.  Original idea, something like "Somewhere in Time" or something.', '2007-10-14 12:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166512, 595542, 84907, '<td valign="top">Some noise and sharpness issues for me on this one.</td>', 'Some noise and sharpness issues for me on this one.', '2007-10-14 12:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166516, 596595, 84907, '<td valign="top">Our fun little friend looks a bit washed out to me.</td>', 'Our fun little friend looks a bit washed out to me.', '2007-10-14 12:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166517, 596839, 84907, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Just the right amount of shot.  Not too much in the background, but not too closely cropped.  Good angles in the shot to bring interest.  Just a really nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice.  Just the right amount of shot.  Not too much in the background, but not too closely cropped.  Good angles in the shot to bring interest.  Just a really nice shot.', '2007-10-14 12:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166522, 596912, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like it  :)  I can assure you no one that hot has ever tried to hitch a ride from me.  :)  Good use of the foreground and background and the sky does quite a bit for the shot as well, but does not steal too much of the attention.  Very nice job on this shot.</td>', 'I like it  :)  I can assure you no one that hot has ever tried to hitch a ride from me.  :)  Good use of the foreground and background and the sky does quite a bit for the shot as well, but does not steal too much of the attention.  Very nice job on this shot.', '2007-10-14 13:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166529, 596673, 84907, '<td valign="top">Ok here we go a slightly morbid shot  :)  I like the idea.  The scythe is backwards and while I understand what that gains for the shot it isn''t how one holds a scythe if they are going to use it.  The death wings lighting is a bit harsh on the bottom side and might benefit more from full lighting.</td>', 'Ok here we go a slightly morbid shot  :)  I like the idea.  The scythe is backwards and while I understand what that gains for the shot it isn''t how one holds a scythe if they are going to use it.  The death wings lighting is a bit harsh on the bottom side and might benefit more from full lighting.', '2007-10-14 13:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166535, 597006, 84907, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Not quite enough for me to slap down a 7 because it could be seen just as a shot of a monkey.  Still a good shot of a monkey, but more needed to jump to 7 and above.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Not quite enough for me to slap down a 7 because it could be seen just as a shot of a monkey.  Still a good shot of a monkey, but more needed to jump to 7 and above.', '2007-10-14 13:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166538, 596996, 67697, '<td valign="top">Earl was FRANTIC!  He had 10 minutes to get to the Halloween party and he could not find the keys to the car.  He just finished painting his nails a lovely mauve color, and then realized that he did not know where his keys were.  Since he was running short on time, he figured that he would just have to dig into his wife''s purse to take her set.  He thought it would be a simple job, the purse was big enough for his hand to fit so he could just reach in and grab the keys and go.<br/> <br/>Well he reached in, and pulled out the address book on top.  No keys.  Then he pulled out a set of very old life savers.  No keys.  He pulled out the wallet.  No money, no keys.  A remote.  Still no keys.  Then he pulled out a neatly folded piece of tissue paper, with something inside.  Earl, being a curious gent, unwrapped the paper.  Inside was a.... (look at the screen peeps).<br/> <br/>Earl smiled, found something better than keys, left and had a very good night.<br/> <br/>May your day be filled with surprising little gifts from your purses and man-purses.</td>', 'Earl was FRANTIC!  He had 10 minutes to get to the Halloween party and he could not find the keys to the car.  He just finished painting his nails a lovely mauve color, and then realized that he did not know where his keys were.  Since he was running short on time, he figured that he would just have to dig into his wife''s purse to take her set.  He thought it would be a simple job, the purse was big enough for his hand to fit so he could just reach in and grab the keys and go. Well he reached in, and pulled out the address book on top.  No keys.  Then he pulled out a set of very old life savers.  No keys.  He pulled out the wallet.  No money, no keys.  A remote.  Still no keys.  Then he pulled out a neatly folded piece of tissue paper, with something inside.  Earl, being a curious gent, unwrapped the paper.  Inside was a.... (look at the screen peeps). Earl smiled, found something better than keys, left and had a very good night. May your day be filled with surprising little gifts from your purses and man-purses.', '2007-10-14 13:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166539, 597028, 84907, '<td valign="top">Lost.  These two squad cars look to be in a parade not searching for anything.</td>', 'Lost.  These two squad cars look to be in a parade not searching for anything.', '2007-10-14 13:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166541, 596731, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the use of light and shadow.  Something looks wrong with her forehead.  I can''t fully put my finger on what, but as it is the top center of the photo it can be really distracting.</td>', 'I like the use of light and shadow.  Something looks wrong with her forehead.  I can''t fully put my finger on what, but as it is the top center of the photo it can be really distracting.', '2007-10-14 13:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4166542, 597022, 84907, '<td valign="top">Fun capture.  Great shot and excellent use of background blur to isolate your subject.  Well done.</td>', 'Fun capture.  Great shot and excellent use of background blur to isolate your subject.  Well done.', '2007-10-14 13:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
