(4168199, 596463, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ShannonLee:</b></div><hr/><i> do u have any idea how good this is???? u must. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, actually :-) I am surprised and pleased it made top 10, though; I did not think this image would be much appreciated. It''s certainly the best finish, by far, of any of my OOB entries, and I have made quite a few :-)<br/> <br/>Thanx, all, for the kind words.<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'Originally posted by ShannonLee: do u have any idea how good this is???? u must.   Yes, actually :-) I am surprised and pleased it made top 10, though; I did not think this image would be much appreciated. It''s certainly the best finish, by far, of any of my OOB entries, and I have made quite a few :-) Thanx, all, for the kind words. R.', '2007-10-15 03:06:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4168200, 596567, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, extremely well conceptualized and beautifully processed. A very worthy winner.</td>', 'Beautiful image, extremely well conceptualized and beautifully processed. A very worthy winner.', '2007-10-15 03:06:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4168201, 596225, 66353, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad to see this ribbon - it''s a brilliant idea and you pulled it off in the best way possible. Congratulations :)</td>', 'I''m so glad to see this ribbon - it''s a brilliant idea and you pulled it off in the best way possible. Congratulations :)', '2007-10-15 03:07:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4168204, 596225, 30861, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. Beyond the amusing and graphic take on  an unusual instance of "searching", the entire gestalt of the image is unusual. There''s a sense of a perfectly flat plane that encompasses everything but the BG building (to a certain extent) and the figures of the searchers, who almost appear to be levitating above this plane, and yet perhaps about to sink into it.<br/> <br/>A very intriguing image on several levels. Great job!<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'I really like this one. Beyond the amusing and graphic take on  an unusual instance of "searching", the entire gestalt of the image is unusual. There''s a sense of a perfectly flat plane that encompasses everything but the BG building (to a certain extent) and the figures of the searchers, who almost appear to be levitating above this plane, and yet perhaps about to sink into it. A very intriguing image on several levels. Great job! R.', '2007-10-15 03:10:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4168206, 595027, 30861, '<td valign="top">This image is beautiful. I didn''t quite feel it responded directly to the challenge topic, but obviously the voters collectively disagreed with me on that :-) Lovely image, great finish.</td>', 'This image is beautiful. I didn''t quite feel it responded directly to the challenge topic, but obviously the voters collectively disagreed with me on that :-) Lovely image, great finish.', '2007-10-15 03:12:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4168208, 596718, 30861, '<td valign="top">The use of DOF here is outstanding, the muted tonalities of the image are flawless, the "pose" showing only half a face (feels like a sly nod to Librodo''s veiled models) is outstanding. In no way does this image shout "shoehorning" to me; I think it''s a very straightforward approach tot he topic. Granted, the squirrel may not actually have been searching for nuts, but he sure as heck LOOKS like he is, and that''s the goal isn''t it?<br/> <br/>Good one!<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'The use of DOF here is outstanding, the muted tonalities of the image are flawless, the "pose" showing only half a face (feels like a sly nod to Librodo''s veiled models) is outstanding. In no way does this image shout "shoehorning" to me; I think it''s a very straightforward approach tot he topic. Granted, the squirrel may not actually have been searching for nuts, but he sure as heck LOOKS like he is, and that''s the goal isn''t it? Good one! R.', '2007-10-15 03:16:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4168212, 596903, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very crisp, appealing image. Congrats on top 10!</td>', 'Very crisp, appealing image. Congrats on top 10!', '2007-10-15 03:16:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4168215, 595470, 30861, '<td valign="top">I thought this was destined for a good finish :-) Rich and strong, nice to see a metaphorical take in the top 10.<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'I thought this was destined for a good finish :-) Rich and strong, nice to see a metaphorical take in the top 10. R.', '2007-10-15 03:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4168217, 597009, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice and minimalist :-) Congrats on top 10.<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'Nice and minimalist :-) Congrats on top 10. R.', '2007-10-15 03:18:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4168219, 596942, 69983, '<td valign="top">RU really a blonde now LOL...  That explains it, redheads finish in the top ten, blondes finish around 50ish! No really nice shot, should have finished higher...........</td>', 'RU really a blonde now LOL...  That explains it, redheads finish in the top ten, blondes finish around 50ish! No really nice shot, should have finished higher...........', '2007-10-15 03:19:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4168220, 596951, 62095, '<td valign="top">What a lovely shot of the city.  I think if the litle chap on the boat had been a bit further across the searching element would have been stronger and you''d have placed highr, maybe.  What do I know? Not a lot.</td>', 'What a lovely shot of the city.  I think if the litle chap on the boat had been a bit further across the searching element would have been stronger and you''d have placed highr, maybe.  What do I know? Not a lot.', '2007-10-15 03:21:56.000000', NULL, 0),
