(4168281, 596463, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top10 finish, Rob. Mind telling us what the heck those guys are searching for?</td>', 'Congrats on your top10 finish, Rob. Mind telling us what the heck those guys are searching for?', '2007-10-15 04:14:07.000000', NULL, 0),
