(4170112, 596225, 72318, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well shot... I know exactly what you mean about people doing that in this kind of photo - i had one shot dead on looking perfect with people moving around, and then one person decided to stop dead waiting for me to take the photo... not realising they were: 1)in the photo and 2)it was being taken!! Ah well, you pulled this one off with great result, congrats :)</td>', 'Nice idea and well shot... I know exactly what you mean about people doing that in this kind of photo - i had one shot dead on looking perfect with people moving around, and then one person decided to stop dead waiting for me to take the photo... not realising they were: 1)in the photo and 2)it was being taken!! Ah well, you pulled this one off with great result, congrats :)', '2007-10-15 20:25:04.000000', NULL, 0),
