(4171271, 595027, 53062, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pineapple:</b></div><hr/><i> Your photo does pose a question - sort of.  But really the answer is that this is a still life composition which suggests searching.  The search could be "why did the photographer compose such a contrived still life?" or "why is such a tiny fisherman using such a huge net?" or, as you said "Where did he go?"  I like the reds and the composition.  8. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><i>Thank you for correction, it is my mistake, the title must "Where did he go?" :D</i></td>', 'Originally posted by pineapple: Your photo does pose a question - sort of.  But really the answer is that this is a still life composition which suggests searching.  The search could be "why did the photographer compose such a contrived still life?" or "why is such a tiny fisherman using such a huge net?" or, as you said "Where did he go?"  I like the reds and the composition.  8.   Thank you for correction, it is my mistake, the title must "Where did he go?" :D', '2007-10-16 10:14:33.000000', NULL, 0),
