(4191644, 596520, 54778, '<td valign="top">Love this picture.. I like the flaws actually.. they give the picture something more..</td>', 'Love this picture.. I like the flaws actually.. they give the picture something more..', '2007-10-24 05:25:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198035, 596225, 66348, '<td valign="top">This is a superb motion shot. Love the editing and your take on the challenge. I think you are catching on rather quickly to DPC. Congrats on the Ribb. and nice to have you here.</td>', 'This is a superb motion shot. Love the editing and your take on the challenge. I think you are catching on rather quickly to DPC. Congrats on the Ribb. and nice to have you here.', '2007-10-26 18:18:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4208304, 597009, 39218, '<td valign="top">The only thing that distracted me on this pic was the perfection of the black cutout that the cat was looking through... if it had had a jagged edge, something that might actually have been chewed by a mouse, this would have been awesome!<br/> <br/>Great concept though.</td>', 'The only thing that distracted me on this pic was the perfection of the black cutout that the cat was looking through... if it had had a jagged edge, something that might actually have been chewed by a mouse, this would have been awesome! Great concept though.', '2007-10-31 11:07:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4208315, 596463, 39218, '<td valign="top">I''m coming to this a bit late, however, from what I have seen of the finish, THIS was the ultimate shot.  <br/> <br/>I always love random shots, where you are using your mind''s eye to capture what you instinctively know is great.  I find sometimes my most spontaneous shots are the huge attention grabbers.<br/> <br/>Huge kudos for getting in there and ''seeing'' this from a perspective most would never consider.  Truly awesome.</td>', 'I''m coming to this a bit late, however, from what I have seen of the finish, THIS was the ultimate shot.   I always love random shots, where you are using your mind''s eye to capture what you instinctively know is great.  I find sometimes my most spontaneous shots are the huge attention grabbers. Huge kudos for getting in there and ''seeing'' this from a perspective most would never consider.  Truly awesome.', '2007-10-31 11:14:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4208337, 596657, 39218, '<td valign="top">Crazy awesome pic.  Really great concept.  Loved everything about it.  Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'Crazy awesome pic.  Really great concept.  Loved everything about it.  Thanks for sharing!', '2007-10-31 11:27:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4208350, 597023, 39218, '<td valign="top">You chose the right one to enter.  <br/> <br/>Great shot... we''ve all been there, and it always seems better in b&amp;w.</td>', 'You chose the right one to enter.   Great shot... we''ve all been there, and it always seems better in b&w.', '2007-10-31 11:33:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4243670, 596958, 74979, '<td valign="top">strong work!  although I see him as being sick (vomiting?), the image is beautiful &amp; graphic enough the viewer can take it to any level of imagination or opinion... <br/> <br/>It defifnitely conveys the loneliness of street life, and I also get the need for companionship..at every level;  and the wonderful place animals have in that role with us humans<br/> <br/>lovely work<br/>~Anni<br/></td>', 'strong work!  although I see him as being sick (vomiting?), the image is beautiful & graphic enough the viewer can take it to any level of imagination or opinion...  It defifnitely conveys the loneliness of street life, and I also get the need for companionship..at every level;  and the wonderful place animals have in that role with us humans lovely work~Anni', '2007-11-13 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4255842, 595017, 72131, '<td valign="top">got a dreamy feel to it</td>', 'got a dreamy feel to it', '2007-11-18 17:34:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4256395, 597013, 10047, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of intense concentration.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of intense concentration.', '2007-11-18 22:06:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4310634, 596716, 39218, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I have a really odd way of looking at things or not, but I LOVED the feel of this pic.  It was borderline cartoonish, which is kind of the idea of a child with a wad of cash picking out the perfect toy, isn''t it?  It''s really retro feeling to me.  It could just as easily be my son (who is 31 now) picking out HIS next Transformer.</td>', 'I don''t know if I have a really odd way of looking at things or not, but I LOVED the feel of this pic.  It was borderline cartoonish, which is kind of the idea of a child with a wad of cash picking out the perfect toy, isn''t it?  It''s really retro feeling to me.  It could just as easily be my son (who is 31 now) picking out HIS next Transformer.', '2007-12-12 10:36:09.000000', NULL, 0),
